 ('Functional Genomics','Connecting genes, expression, and biological function to understand complex plant–microbe–soil relationships.','spatial-regulation','GENOMICS'),
 ('AI–Protein Modeling','AI-guided modeling and design of NLR immune receptor function for temperature adaptation and disease resistance.','nlr-temperature','PROTEIN DESIGN'),
