funding='''<section class="page-intro wrap funding-summary"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH SUPPORT</p><h1>Funding</h1><p class="page-lead">Our integrated research is supported through a combination of federal competitive funding and commodity-group competitive funding. The Solanki Lab is currently supported through <span id="federal">programs from the National Science Foundation (NSF), U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA)</span>, and <span id="commodity">commodity groups supporting corn, soybean, and wheat research</span>. This support enables our research while providing opportunities for graduate and undergraduate students to participate in discovery and training. We gratefully acknowledge all organizations and stakeholders who support our work.</p><p class="funding-keyline">NSF · USDA · Corn · Soybean · Wheat · Research and Student Training</p></section>'''
